  procedureSteps:
  - Seal the empty syringe and measure mass m1
  - Draw water into the syringe to the 5 mL mark
  - Seal the nozzle and measure filled mass m2
  - Density = (m2 - m1) / 5 mL; note room temperature
  duration: 12
